The maintainers place this starter kit in the public domain so a publisher can
copy it without a licence question.

Your published bundle needs its own licence. Choose one and state it here,
replacing this file. A result bundle with no licence is not reusable evidence,
and a reader cannot tell whether they may quote your numbers.

The corpus fixtures remain under the terms in the a11y-benchmark repository;
see its LICENSE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Publishing a result does not
relicense the corpus.

